# Laravel API — http://localhost:8001
# Порядок: фільм → зал → сеанс → клієнт → квиток

### Фільми — список
GET http://localhost:8001/api/movies
Accept: application/json

### Фільми — створити
POST http://localhost:8001/api/movies
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Dune: Part Two", "description": "Paul Atreides unites with the Fremen", "genre": "Sci-Fi", "duration_minutes": 166, "release_date": "2024-03-01", "age_rating": "12+"}

### Фільми — один
GET http://localhost:8001/api/movies/1
Accept: application/json

### Фільми — оновити
PATCH http://localhost:8001/api/movies/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"age_rating": "16+"}

### Зали — створити
POST http://localhost:8001/api/halls
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Hall 1", "type": "IMAX", "rows_count": 10, "seats_per_row": 12}

### Зали — список
GET http://localhost:8001/api/halls
Accept: application/json

### Зали — оновити
PUT http://localhost:8001/api/halls/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Hall 1", "type": "VIP", "rows_count": 8, "seats_per_row": 10}

### Сеанси — створити (зв'язок з фільмом і залом)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/screenings
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"movie_id": 1, "hall_id": 1, "starts_at": "2026-09-20 18:30", "price": 250, "language": "UA"}

### Сеанси — список
GET http://localhost:8001/api/screenings
Accept: application/json

### Сеанси — оновити
PATCH http://localhost:8001/api/screenings/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"price": 220}

### Клієнти — створити
POST http://localhost:8001/api/customers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"first_name": "Olena", "last_name": "Koval", "email": "olena@example.com", "phone": "+380501112233", "birth_date": "2000-05-10"}

### Клієнти — список
GET http://localhost:8001/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Квитки — створити (зв'язок з сеансом і клієнтом, ціна береться з сеансу)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/tickets
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"screening_id": 1, "customer_id": 1, "seat_row": 5, "seat_number": 7}

### Квитки — те саме місце ще раз (очікується 422)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/tickets
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"screening_id": 1, "customer_id": 1, "seat_row": 5, "seat_number": 7}

### Квитки — список
GET http://localhost:8001/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### Квитки — оплатити
PATCH http://localhost:8001/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "paid"}

### Квитки — видалити
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json

### Клієнти — видалити
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/customers/1
Accept: application/json

### Сеанси — видалити
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/screenings/1
Accept: application/json

### Зали — видалити
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/halls/1
Accept: application/json

### Фільми — видалити
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/movies/1
Accept: application/json
